WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.290
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:03.200
<i>Together with my companions, Barda and Jasmine, I defeated
several terrifying monsters and recovered six gems.</i>

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.760
<i>But to be honest, when I left the Forests of Silence to go on a journey with a stubborn old guy,</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>Hey!</i>

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>along with this unreliable boy,</i>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>What was that?</i>

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.600
<i>I could only hope that
everything would be alright.</i>

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.100
<i>But by working together,
we've finally made it this far!</i>

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>There's only one gem remaining!</i>

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.710
<i>Our last perilous destination, The Valley of the Lost
where the diamond is hidden, is just right ahead!</i>

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.900
We will find them without fail.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.500
They couldn't have gotten far.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.400
Yes sir!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.000
Jasmine, Barda!

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.400
Jasmine!

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.500
We made it...?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.400
Yeah.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:11.200
It looks like we were washed down a
separate channel of the River Tor.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.900
Oh right, what about Dain?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.290
Kree?

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.700
Is something over there, Kree?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.300
What is it, Jasmine?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.770
Incredible! So this is the city of Tora!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.600
That seems to be the entrance over there.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.700
So, is Dain in there?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.800
But why is it so quiet?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.800
There are no guards near the gate...

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.700
...and didn't Tora fall to the enemy?

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:06.100
It could be that Tora's magic was so great that not
even the Shadow Lord could penetrate the city.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.200
If that's the case, then the
heir to Deltora could be here.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:15.300
He may very well be waiting for us to come
here, under the protection of Tora's magic.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.100
For now, finding Dain is more
important than the heir!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.350
Let's go.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.700
Let's try walking through.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.400
Wh-What on earth is this?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:08.000
Calm down! It doesn't appear to be harming us.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.860
Let's hurry and get through this tunnel!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.900
What was that just now?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.900
I'm not sure. We do seem to
be unharmed, though...

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:49.700
It is said that the city of Tora was carved out
of one huge block of stone using magic.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.900
There's no other way to say it:
This city is built to perfection.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.600
But, there is no one living here.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.200
What a breathtaking city!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:18.000
It's as if people were here
until just a moment ago.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.300
What's the matter, Lief?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.600
The emerald has dulled.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.100
Is there an evil presence in this city?

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:28.400
Or perhaps...

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.000
Oh no...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.310
I wonder if Dain is alright...

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.900
Wait a moment, Doom!

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.800
Isn't it time for us to rest?

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.900
We're almost there.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.400
Look, you can see it; the city of Tora.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.330
Dain is in there?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:53.300
Yes, and those three he fled
with may also be there.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.100
Dain?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.300
Dain!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.400
Dain...

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.600
Jasmine...

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.900
Lief... Barda...

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.570
Are you alright, Dain?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.300
I suddenly felt really
unwell for some reason...

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.400
Be careful!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.800
Dain, did you find your father and mother?

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:46.100
This is... There is writing
engraved on this thing.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:54.500
<i>"We, the people of Tora, swear loyalty to Adin,
King of Deltora, and all of his blood who follow him.</i>

00:07:54.500 --> 00:08:00.400
<i>If ever this vow is broken, may this
rock, our city's heart, break also,</i>

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:06.000
<i>and may we be swept away,
forever to regret our dishonour."</i>

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.000
So this is the stone column.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.100
The flames are gone, and it's full of cracks.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:23.630
<i>The emerald, symbol of honour, dulls in the
presence of evil, and when a vow is broken.</i>

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.700
Tora broke their vow.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.100
And this is why the emerald is... but why?

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:34.200
There is a letter from the king here...

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.100
This is probably the cause of it.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:41.300
"The king thanks you for this message.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:44.400
He will attend to your
request when time allows."

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.500
The exact same thing is written on this too.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.200
This is the same as what
happened to the people of Del.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:54.000
The people of Tora must have
also sent petitions to the king,

00:08:54.800 --> 00:09:00.000
but the king did nothing about them and just
replied with the exact same letter instead.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:05.510
That's right. On top of that, this was
the last letter that King Endon sent.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.000
"People of Tora:

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:13.800
The Belt of Deltora is lost, the
Shadow Lord has returned.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:19.800
With the help of a true friend, I have escaped with the Queen and our unborn child.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:24.300
I ask you to offer sanctuary in
fulfillment of your ancient vow."

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:35.200
But the Torans resented the king for fleeing,
tearing up this letter and thus violating the oath.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.300
So that's how they were banished, then...

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:41.200
After having managed to come this far...

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.800
I thought I would find the whereabouts
of my father and mother...

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.200
To think that it would end like this...

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.300
Dain, hang on!

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:55.400
I beg you. Please take me away from this city.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.400
I don't want to be here anymore.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:02.000
Let's go. We have no further business in this city.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:02.860
Dain...

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.900
What's wrong, Doom? Are you not going in?

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.500
That's right; there is no need to.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:16.200
This tunnel is the only way
in or out of the city of Tora.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:19.400
They are sure to appear
if we wait long enough.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.200
Eavesdroppers?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.100
Not very considerate, are you?

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:33.300
I see. So they are inside this city, are they?

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.700
What's wrong, Kree?

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.300
What? There are Grey Guards at the entrance?!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.800
Doom! Neridah!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:03.000
Lief! Lief, help! Doom is...

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.300
Stop right there!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.200
Lief!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.100
What the hell is this?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.400
No!!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.400
Wait!!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.500
What's happening?!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.500
Ah, I understand!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:24.100
The city of Tora is protected
by a strong magical power.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:27.270
Those who have evil in their
hearts cannot enter this city!

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:31.990
In other words, we are safe from
them as long as we stay inside?

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:35.600
Doom! It's safe inside!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.600
Hurry up and get through the tunnel!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:43.300
Doom, why aren't you going in?!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:47.500
If you're not evil of heart,
hurry up and enter the city!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.220
Could it be that Doom is...

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.700
I will never go inside that city!

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.700
I would much sooner die fighting here!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.730
Please, save Doom!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.310
Can't be helped, then.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.810
Dain? What's the matter?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.740
Just do as we've told you.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:17.740
What are you doing?!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.660
Don't go in there!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.340
Doom...

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.300
With this, we will know
the truth about Doom.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.380
Doom...?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.880
Are you satisfied now?

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.090
Doom...

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:23.600
This is what happens when someone who lives with
hatred and anger goes through that tunnel.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:30.300
There is no need to rush.
This tunnel is their only exit.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.860
Call reinforcements!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.700
That is why I didn't want to enter this city.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:43.100
I tried to go through that tunnel
once before, but I couldn't stand it.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.200
Doom,

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.830
just who on earth are you?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:53.300
I don't even know that myself.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:57.400
I wonder what else I lost
along with my real name.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:02.600
But, what I do remember is
being in the Shadowlands.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:09.300
I was made to fight a Vraal in an arena,

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.100
and was injured.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.800
But I don't remember anything before that.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.200
Those memories had vanished.

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:22.100
But that means you managed to
escape from the Shadowlands!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.370
Yes, I fled from that place.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:30.700
They chased after me immediately, and
I fought my way through Dread Mountain.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:35.500
I managed to get away, but I
suffered an even worse wound.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.900
At that point, I was very nearly dead.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.700
And then...

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.200
A man saved me.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:57.360
He was the man who lived in the cave
in the forest at Kinrest, wasn't he?

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:02.000
I see... So you three saw his grave, then?

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:08.080
I let him die... I let my saviour die.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.900
He stood desperately in the face of death.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.290
The Grey Guards had tracked me down.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:21.700
The man named Doom hid me from them,

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.300
and protected me.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:33.200
So I built a grave for him.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.280
And until I could remember my real name,

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:43.100
I decided to assume his.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.540
You've been through some hardship.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:16:00.100
Please understand, Doom. I'm not digging
into your past out of mere curiosity.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:04.030
No, I just blurted it out on my own.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:09.800
So you've been to the city of Tora before?

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.800
That's why I didn't want to let you go.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:19.100
If you were to find out the current state of this city, you would lose all hope;

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.900
that's why I tried to stop you.

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:27.160
Doom... if only I had listened to you.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:31.660
I wish I had never come to this place.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:38.600
We are safe from the enemy as long as we
stay here, but we can't just sit here forever.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.800
Anyway, let's get out from here.
We need to at least get Dain out safely.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.500
But how?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.000
There is a way.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:57.190
Like a rat in a bag. It's only a matter of time.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.900
Aren't there more of them now?

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:00.940
Yeah.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.200
Jasmine, here's my cloak.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.200
Right.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.500
Alright. Let's go!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.000
Fools! They've lost their minds.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.900
Attack!

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:24.200
It's working! Let's use this chance
to get as far away as possible!

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:28.900
No... stop! Wait!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.200
Geez, I said stop!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.700
Hey, wait! I want to get
away from here after all!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.400
What the hell are you doing?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:52.200
They are hiding over there.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:54.300
You idiot. Look at what you've done!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.400
Hey!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:04.920
Dain...!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.300
I will... also fight!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.390
Dain, stay strong!

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:19.190
We can do this!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.190
Barely.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.800
You're looking a little better already.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.070
Thanks to you.

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:32.600
What's wrong, Lief? Stay focused!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:37.800
What am I worrying about at a time like this?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.630
Shit!

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.800
This is hopeless! They just keep coming!

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.200
I know!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:08.900
Don't let him escape!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:15.620
Lief!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.700
Neridah, grab on!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.800
Everyone, jump in the back!

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:23.400
Jasmine, Dain!

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.300
Lief!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:32.900
Damn it all!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.060
It seems like we managed to escape.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:47.100
Thanks to you, that is. I suppose
I should give you my gratitude.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.500
Is <i>that</i> how you thank
someone who saved you?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.110
It's thanks to the Muddlets.

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:55.900
We are planning to meet up with a travelling
merchant called Steven after this.

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.830
What say you, Dain?
Are you coming with us?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:06.080
If you can forgive me, then let me fight the
Shadow Lord as member of the Resistance!

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.000
That is fine by me.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:11.600
Dain...

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.500
Thank you, Jasmine.

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:18.700
It may have only been for a short while, but I enjoyed travelling with you.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.100
Me too.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:25.060
Where are you three planning on going next?

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.700
You couldn't be heading for the
Valley of the Lost, could you?

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.610
Yeah.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.500
Wait, Lief!

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:36.650
You're right. We are going
to the Valley of the Lost.

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.870
Do you know anything about that place?

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.550
That valley is evil.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:47.300
It's where wandering souls gather;
a place of never-ending suffering.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:51.880
Could it be that you're looking for
the diamond hidden in there?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.630
Diamond?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.700
And so what if we are?

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:05.280
I would tell you to give it up. I know of many
people who went into that valley to find it.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:08.000
But not a single one of them ever returned.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:14.200
Rather than that, you should join the Resistance
and fight the Shadow Lord together with us.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.400
It became clear to me as
we fought back there;

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.000
you three would be a formidable
asset to us in battle.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:28.920
I'm glad that you've acknowledged us in that way, but we have something that we must do, no matter what.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:36.400
Sorry to disappoint you, but this would be the
second time we have rejected your invitation.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:41.500
I will give you one final warning.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:47.400
Assuming that you do reach your
goal, only despair awaits you.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.300
Despair?

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:11.960
Come on,

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.210
we must go as well.

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.250
Yes, let's go.

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:22.600
To where the final gem, the diamond is
hidden. The Valley of the Lost!

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:26.800
Even if only despair awaits us there.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:47.800
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:57.680
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:05.110
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:14.780
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.460
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:25.040
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:29.340
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.760
fades into the distance

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:43.060
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.400
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:56.240
I'll start moving all over again

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:08.200
<i>The Torans.</i>

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:12.400
<i>One of the seven tribes,
possessing powerful magic.</i>

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:19.800
<i>They pledged eternal loyalty to the King of Deltora, but then
broke that vow and were exiled from their own city.</i>

00:24:20.900 --> 00:24:24.220
Neridah joined us on our journey to the valley.

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:27.800
You can't do that! Jasmine is suspicious of you.

00:24:28.150 --> 00:24:31.020
Then some terrifying monsters
appeared before us.

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:34.740
The Guardian of The Valley

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:34.740
Next time, 'The Guardian of The Valley'.

00:24:49.770 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
